[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/props/plant_species.gd" id="1_species"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://blender_assets/coral_pink.glb" id="2_model"]
[ext_resource type="Material" path="res://game/props/coral.tres" id="3_surface"]

; The big branching one, and the reason the reef has a skyline. Scattered
; thinly and singly: one of these is three metres across, and a clump of them
; would be a wall.
;
; The depth band is where the whole reef lives and it is the same on all four:
; above_water and below are metres relative to sea level, so -30 .. -8 is the
; sunlit shelf between the shallows a swimmer wades through and the dark. No
; VAT — coral does not swim, it leans, and vivid_plant's wind rotation does
; that for nothing.

